# Original description (presenter-editable, idempotency anchor)
un escritorio de desarrollador desbordado: un repo heredado sin documentacion, issues abiertos, una terminal con errores, el reloj corriendo

# Enriched generation prompt (what image generation consumes)
Create a portrait editorial vector-style symbolic illustration for a presentation aside. It should convey the pressure of inherited software work that exceeds typing code: disconnected modules, unresolved loops and competing paths, with a restrained coral-red thread beginning to organize the chaos. Use a flat poster-like visual language, light ground, dark #3B3535 structural masses, one sparing #DA1B2E accent, thin contour lines and strong white negative space. No readable text, letters, numbers, logos, UI, dashboards, charts, photorealism, literal offices, people, furniture, buildings, shadows, watermarks or signatures.
